WEBVTT

01:38.960 --> 01:41.785
[Episode 1]

01:50.319 --> 01:51.847
Uncle Sun.

01:52.720 --> 01:54.860
What exactly happened to my dad?

01:55.720 --> 01:57.679
Don't worry.

01:57.679 --> 02:00.520
Your dad was only taken in for questioning.

02:00.520 --> 02:02.279
Do I have to leave?

02:02.279 --> 02:04.759
The creditors have set their sights on you.

02:04.759 --> 02:07.360
I must take you to a safe place now.

02:07.360 --> 02:09.240
But I have my own plans.

02:09.240 --> 02:11.360
I've already got my foundation program offer.

02:11.360 --> 02:13.800
I want to follow my mom's last wishes
and study abroad.

02:13.800 --> 02:15.520
Ye,

02:15.520 --> 02:18.279
your father's assets have been frozen.

02:18.279 --> 02:20.119
It's hard to get a visa.

02:20.119 --> 02:22.800
Your family has no other relatives
here in Beijing.

02:22.800 --> 02:25.399
Right now,
I have to handle your father's affairs.

02:25.399 --> 02:27.240
Leaving you here...

02:27.240 --> 02:29.322
I just can't stop worrying.

02:32.879 --> 02:34.559
Then where are we going now?

02:34.559 --> 02:37.200
Zhazhating. To your aunt's place.

02:37.200 --> 02:39.447
Zhazhating?

02:44.985 --> 02:47.394
[Zhazhating]

03:00.159 --> 03:01.400
- Move way!
- Don't run!

03:01.400 --> 03:02.760
- Stop!
- Move!

03:02.760 --> 03:04.399
Move!

03:04.399 --> 03:06.697
Don't run! Stop!

03:07.679 --> 03:09.320
- Out of the way!
- Out of the way!

03:09.320 --> 03:11.520
Wu Lao Er! Wu Lao Er!

03:11.520 --> 03:12.520
Move, move, move!

03:12.520 --> 03:13.760
- Get out of the way!
- Move!

03:13.760 --> 03:15.430
Wu Lao Er!

03:16.320 --> 03:18.160
Wu! Wu!

03:18.160 --> 03:20.280
What's going on?

03:37.279 --> 03:39.279
C-C-Catch the thief!

03:39.279 --> 03:41.480
Wu Lao Er stole Mr. Zhu's phone!

03:41.480 --> 03:43.552
- What's wrong so early?
- Unbelievable!

03:43.552 --> 03:44.719
Mr. Zhu's phone was stolen.

03:44.719 --> 03:45.920
Mr. Zhu?

03:45.920 --> 03:47.999
- It was Wu Lao Er, wasn't it?
- Of course.

03:47.999 --> 03:50.439
Wu, don't forget to pick up your cousin!

03:50.439 --> 03:52.279
- Don't worry.
- Wu, follow me!

03:52.279 --> 03:53.640
- Slow down!
- Hurry, hurry!

03:53.640 --> 03:56.160
Be careful!

04:03.159 --> 04:04.719
Wu Lao Er!

04:04.719 --> 04:05.839
Isn't that Wu Lao Er?

04:05.839 --> 04:06.879
Stealing again?

04:06.879 --> 04:09.906
That kid has never done a good deed.

04:14.610 --> 04:15.679
Let's split up!

04:15.679 --> 04:17.710
- You got it!
- Okay.

04:28.080 --> 04:30.172
Wu Lao Er! Wu Lao Er!

04:32.359 --> 04:34.697
Hurry up, Fuzz!

04:52.080 --> 04:53.120
What's wrong?

04:53.120 --> 04:54.760
What's going on?

04:54.760 --> 04:57.460
The GPS isn't quite right.

05:27.799 --> 05:29.000
Oh my god.

05:29.000 --> 05:31.295
It's a swarm of punks.

05:31.919 --> 05:33.622
Run?

05:35.039 --> 05:36.372
Run?

05:37.080 --> 05:39.939
- Where's the phone?
- What phone?

05:40.640 --> 05:42.080
Don't play dumb with me.

05:42.080 --> 05:43.320
There are cameras on the street.

05:43.320 --> 05:45.239
You even dare to steal from a teacher, huh?

05:45.239 --> 05:47.765
No, what are you guys talking about?

05:49.310 --> 05:50.399
Wu! Wu!

05:50.399 --> 05:52.479
Look, I just swiped a phone.
No need to be so brutal!

05:52.479 --> 05:53.520
Hand it over.

05:53.520 --> 05:56.910
You're pinning me down. How can I hand it over?

06:09.581 --> 06:10.760
What are you doing?

06:10.760 --> 06:12.810
Getting the phone.

06:24.012 --> 06:25.581
Fuzz.

06:26.399 --> 06:27.960
Hu!

06:28.640 --> 06:30.960
- Take it.
- I...

06:44.039 --> 06:46.030
Get lost!

06:53.399 --> 06:54.640
A car from Beijing.

06:54.640 --> 06:55.760
Looks fancy.

06:55.760 --> 06:59.935
Wu. C-C-Could it be your cousin?

07:01.039 --> 07:02.479
Ye.

07:02.479 --> 07:03.560
I know.

07:03.560 --> 07:07.479
Things here might be a bit different
from what you expected.

07:07.479 --> 07:10.000
But at least you have
a relative to look after you.

07:10.000 --> 07:12.400
I've reminded them repeatedly.

07:12.400 --> 07:14.960
Make sure you stay safe.

07:14.960 --> 07:17.520
This is not a bit different.

07:17.520 --> 07:19.640
It's three people bullying one.

07:19.640 --> 07:21.872
The place is crawling with thugs.

07:23.479 --> 07:25.279
Ye.

07:25.279 --> 07:26.479
Don't get involved.

07:26.479 --> 07:29.635
Just get some fresh air. Who cares about them?

07:35.760 --> 07:38.440
What's this?

08:07.440 --> 08:10.200
Hey, beautiful.

08:10.200 --> 08:13.560
Hello. I am Hao Cheng Gong.

08:13.560 --> 08:15.320
The richest man in Zhazhating.

08:15.320 --> 08:17.422
What's wrong with you?

08:21.399 --> 08:22.760
You're from Beijing?

08:22.760 --> 08:24.839
None of your business.

08:25.880 --> 08:27.826
Hey, guys.

08:30.479 --> 08:32.040
You three.

08:32.040 --> 08:33.160
You're locals, right?

08:33.160 --> 08:34.680
Yeah, what of it?

08:34.680 --> 08:35.800
Just asking for directions.

08:35.800 --> 08:38.200
How do I get to Xuan Island?

08:38.200 --> 08:39.479
Xuan...?

08:39.479 --> 08:41.359
- Xuan Island.
- Go away...

08:41.359 --> 08:43.060
Not for free.

08:44.239 --> 08:46.621
- 100.
- 100?

08:46.621 --> 08:49.080
100 each, then.

08:51.479 --> 08:53.440
- Wait...
- Is that enough?

08:53.440 --> 08:54.719
No need to pay.

08:54.719 --> 08:57.080
The row of red houses across
from the lighthouse.

08:57.080 --> 08:58.960
Keep going along this road.

08:58.960 --> 09:00.320
Go about a kilometer on the main road.

09:00.320 --> 09:02.359
Turn left at the roundabout, then left again.

09:02.359 --> 09:04.639
Take the small path to the end.

09:04.639 --> 09:05.760
That's so complicated.

09:05.760 --> 09:09.320
No wonder the GPS got confused.
Take it, take it.

09:09.320 --> 09:10.359
Thank you.

09:10.359 --> 09:12.080
City people are so generous.

09:12.080 --> 09:13.480
Give it back.

09:13.480 --> 09:15.440
He's already in the car.
How can I give it back?

09:15.440 --> 09:18.410
He's like a walking ATM.

09:20.680 --> 09:22.400
Uncle Sun.

09:22.400 --> 09:23.863
Is this what you meant by...

09:23.863 --> 09:25.440
simple and honest locals?

09:25.440 --> 09:26.759
Small town.

09:26.759 --> 09:28.080
As long as the money is right,

09:28.080 --> 09:30.222
everything is easy.

10:05.119 --> 10:07.760
- Mr. Zhu.
- Mr. Zhu.

10:19.765 --> 10:21.960
Look at your hair. What are these colors?

10:21.960 --> 10:24.622
- Do you even look like students?
- Ow, ow, ow! That hurts!

10:25.197 --> 10:26.210
Where's Wu Lao Er?

10:26.210 --> 10:27.440
Don't worry. We found him.

10:27.440 --> 10:29.987
Wu gets things done.

10:30.880 --> 10:32.463
Here.

10:42.680 --> 10:43.839
See if there are any problems.

10:43.839 --> 10:46.759
- The phone is fine, but what's that smell?
- If it's fine,

10:46.759 --> 10:48.572
we should go.

10:49.639 --> 10:50.794
You two head back first.

10:50.794 --> 10:51.879
Xing Wu.

10:51.879 --> 10:54.382
Come with me. I need to talk to you.

10:56.839 --> 11:00.119
Take the shortcut and tell my mom
that my cousin is almost here.

11:00.119 --> 11:01.682
Okay.

11:01.682 --> 11:03.239
[Mahjong Club]

11:04.239 --> 11:07.359
Discard South first for peace of mind.

11:07.359 --> 11:09.800
Come back again. West Wind.

11:09.800 --> 11:11.119
Fang.

11:11.119 --> 11:13.800
Your makeup today is quite elaborate.

11:13.800 --> 11:15.647
Pretty nice, huh.

11:15.647 --> 11:18.122
What's the occasion?

11:18.122 --> 11:22.359
Isn't my niece from Beijing about to arrive?

11:22.359 --> 11:23.440
Fang Fang.

11:23.440 --> 11:25.600
I heard that your niece

11:25.600 --> 11:27.861
can get you 50,000 yuan.

11:28.599 --> 11:30.359
That's quite a lot.

11:31.359 --> 11:33.560
You're going to strike it rich.

11:33.560 --> 11:35.639
You can pay off all those debts.

11:35.639 --> 11:38.900
Who's the big mouth?

11:38.900 --> 11:40.120
Did you forget?

11:40.120 --> 11:42.960
Last time you were blowing my hair,
you told me yourself.

11:42.960 --> 11:45.085
You really have the memory of a fish.

11:45.719 --> 11:47.200
Right, right.

11:47.200 --> 11:48.880
I forgot.

11:48.880 --> 11:51.640
It's not about the money. She's family.

11:51.640 --> 11:53.920
Isn't it only natural to take care of her?

11:53.920 --> 11:55.160
I don't need the money.

11:55.160 --> 11:57.486
Fang Fang, you have relatives in the capital?

11:57.486 --> 11:58.840
Why didn't you ever mention it?

11:58.840 --> 12:01.080
Well, we haven't been in touch.

12:01.080 --> 12:04.560
She's my sister's child.
Her family's business is huge.

12:04.560 --> 12:05.719
So successful.

12:05.719 --> 12:07.839
But my sister passed away early.

12:07.839 --> 12:09.080
She passed away two years ago.

12:09.080 --> 12:12.639
My brother-in-law still treats me like family.

12:12.639 --> 12:14.839
I've already told my brother-in-law.

12:14.839 --> 12:17.920
He must come and develop our Zhazhating.

12:17.920 --> 12:21.541
He'll turn this place into a resort.
It's best to build an apartment block.

12:21.541 --> 12:23.935
I'll give each of you a unit then.

12:24.639 --> 12:26.525
- Really?
- Thank you!

12:26.525 --> 12:29.200
- I'll be waiting for that.
- Sure, sure.

12:29.200 --> 12:32.080
Your phone is ringing.

12:32.080 --> 12:33.719
Answer it first.

12:33.719 --> 12:35.752
Okay.

12:40.472 --> 12:42.280
Hey.

12:43.280 --> 12:44.359
Don't be in such a rush.

12:44.359 --> 12:45.800
Didn't I tell you?

12:45.800 --> 12:47.560
Once the money tree arrives,

12:47.560 --> 12:50.445
I'll wire you the money right away.

12:51.200 --> 12:53.372
Hello? Hello?

12:54.639 --> 12:57.122
What the hell?

13:01.640 --> 13:03.560
You're really persistent.

13:03.560 --> 13:05.119
You've been at it for two years.

13:05.119 --> 13:07.320
How many times has it been?

13:07.320 --> 13:10.960
We were teacher and student, after all.

13:10.960 --> 13:15.585
I just want to talk to you.
What about a heart-to-heart talk?

13:16.639 --> 13:18.359
I heard...

13:18.359 --> 13:21.960
you've been repairing phones at Shunyi
for almost two years now.

13:21.960 --> 13:24.119
What, are you addicted to repairs?

13:24.119 --> 13:27.400
Do you really not plan to return
and take the college entrance exam?

13:27.400 --> 13:29.160
How do you know...

13:29.160 --> 13:31.810
I'll get into a good college if I return?

13:32.800 --> 13:34.440
I think I'm doing fine now.

13:34.440 --> 13:37.560
I'm your teacher. Don't I know you?

13:37.560 --> 13:39.560
You just feel that...

13:39.560 --> 13:41.400
your mom is all alone now.

13:41.400 --> 13:42.719
She has to pay for your school,

13:42.719 --> 13:44.239
pay off the family debts,

13:44.239 --> 13:46.280
and find time to take care of your grandma.

13:46.280 --> 13:49.489
So you want to help her out.

13:50.839 --> 13:53.119
But Xing Wu, can't you use your brain?

13:53.119 --> 13:55.800
Come back to school now.

13:55.800 --> 13:57.760
Prepare to get into a good college.

13:57.760 --> 14:01.047
That's the best way to repay your mom.

14:01.759 --> 14:02.999
Look.

14:02.999 --> 14:05.999
You used to be quite a big deal around here.

14:05.999 --> 14:08.519
Remember that paper airplane
contest in Zhazhating?

14:08.519 --> 14:11.937
- The airplane you made flew so high and--
- All right, all right.

14:11.937 --> 14:13.560
It was just a stupid paper airplane.

14:13.560 --> 14:14.759
Can you stop bringing it up?

14:14.759 --> 14:17.400
And that aerospace model contest then,
weren't you the champion too?

14:17.400 --> 14:18.920
Wu Lao Er was your student too.

14:18.920 --> 14:20.280
He's been stealing for two years
since he graduated--

14:20.280 --> 14:24.359
Don't mention him to me, okay?
He's different from you.

14:24.359 --> 14:27.720
There's a gap between people.

14:27.720 --> 14:30.360
Just like our Zhazhating.

14:30.360 --> 14:32.640
Different alleys, different accents.

14:32.640 --> 14:34.879
Different paths, different folks.

14:34.879 --> 14:37.080
Anyway, in my eyes,

14:37.080 --> 14:39.239
you're a promising talent.

14:39.239 --> 14:41.400
When your mom withdrew you,

14:41.400 --> 14:43.639
she had no other choice.

14:43.639 --> 14:45.639
Some things are in the past.

14:45.639 --> 14:49.160
It's been two years, what's holding you back?

14:53.775 --> 14:55.761
Are you and your wife still fighting?

14:55.761 --> 14:58.080
He Xiao Lian and I...

14:58.080 --> 15:01.080
We're talking about you.
Why bring me into this?

15:01.080 --> 15:03.639
Xing Wu.
I've talked to you so many times this year.

15:03.639 --> 15:06.250
Listen up, think about it.

15:06.999 --> 15:08.359
Are you done?

15:08.359 --> 15:09.759
I'm done listening.

15:09.759 --> 15:11.685
Goodbye, Mr. Zhu.

15:13.200 --> 15:15.040
Think it over!

15:15.040 --> 15:17.760
Call me when you've decided.

15:18.960 --> 15:20.119
Auntie Fang!

15:20.119 --> 15:21.479
C-C-Cousin...

15:21.479 --> 15:22.960
Auntie Fang!

15:22.960 --> 15:25.599
Your niece is here.
Xing Wu told me to let you know.

15:25.599 --> 15:26.639
Son!

15:26.639 --> 15:28.800
What's with your hair? Who dyed it for you?

15:28.800 --> 15:30.160
Me! I did.

15:30.160 --> 15:32.160
I just got that new hair dye cream.

15:32.160 --> 15:35.040
They're not in school right now,
so I'm using them as test subjects.

15:35.040 --> 15:36.566
But it looks terrible.

15:36.566 --> 15:38.720
They'll look like traffic lights
standing there.

15:38.720 --> 15:41.440
- Dye it back for them.
- Dye it back right now.

15:41.440 --> 15:42.519
- Fine.
- Looking like some punk.

15:42.519 --> 15:43.759
Fine, fine.

15:43.759 --> 15:45.200
Fuzz, Hu.

15:45.200 --> 15:46.200
Tell Liu Nian.

15:46.200 --> 15:47.719
Set off the firecrackers!

15:47.719 --> 15:48.719
- Okay.
- Got it.

15:48.719 --> 15:51.080
Gosh, look at this hair color.

15:51.080 --> 15:52.200
Hold my bag for a second.

15:52.200 --> 15:54.600
I'm going to welcome my money tree.

15:54.600 --> 15:56.800
- We're all going.
- Let's go, let's go.

15:56.800 --> 15:58.910
- I'll take it.
- Okay.

15:58.910 --> 16:04.722
[Zhazhating]

16:06.160 --> 16:07.959
She's here, she's here.

16:16.839 --> 16:18.040
Is she here?

16:18.040 --> 16:20.330
Light it up! Light it!

16:50.160 --> 16:51.239
Oh, my.

16:51.239 --> 16:53.434
- How lively!
- Welcome, welcome!

16:57.359 --> 16:59.320
Hello. You're Qing Ye's aunt?

16:59.320 --> 17:00.599
- Yes, that's right.
- Li Lan Fang?

17:00.599 --> 17:03.066
- Yes, yes.
- We spoke on the phone.

17:03.066 --> 17:04.759
- Secretary Sun Hai.
- Yes, exactly.

17:04.759 --> 17:06.319
Hello, hello.

17:06.319 --> 17:08.656
- That's Ye.
- Yes.

17:27.400 --> 17:31.403
Ye, I finally get to see you. Give me a hug.

17:32.039 --> 17:34.120
So stylish.

17:34.120 --> 17:37.120
She's really from the city.

17:37.120 --> 17:38.880
You've grown so tall.

17:38.880 --> 17:39.880
Do you remember me?

17:39.880 --> 17:42.360
You came here when you were little.

17:43.519 --> 17:44.719
It's okay if you don't remember.

17:44.719 --> 17:45.999
You're here now, anyway.

17:45.999 --> 17:49.319
Don't you worry. From now on, I, your aunt,

17:49.319 --> 17:52.135
will take good care of you.

17:53.440 --> 17:54.559
Listen up, neighbors!

17:54.559 --> 17:57.759
This is my niece who came all the way
from Beijing.

17:57.759 --> 17:59.519
Qing Ye.

17:59.519 --> 18:00.519
Good.

18:00.519 --> 18:01.840
Welcome, welcome!

18:01.840 --> 18:04.400
Hope you all look out for her.

18:04.400 --> 18:06.210
Sure, no problem.

18:06.840 --> 18:07.880
Thank you.

18:07.880 --> 18:10.640
Liu Nian, go get the suitcases.

18:11.360 --> 18:13.200
That's all, everyone. Thank you.

18:13.200 --> 18:14.719
- We can head off now.
- Wonderful.

18:14.719 --> 18:16.972
Let's go, let's go.

18:16.972 --> 18:18.947
Come on, let's go inside.

18:18.947 --> 18:21.039
I want to say a few words to Uncle Sun.

18:21.039 --> 18:23.200
Sure, no problem. We'll head in first.

18:23.200 --> 18:24.440
Liu Nian, hurry up.

18:24.440 --> 18:26.475
Coming!

18:29.519 --> 18:30.960
Uncle Sun.

18:30.960 --> 18:32.799
You've been with my dad for so many years.

18:32.799 --> 18:34.799
You must prove his innocence.

18:34.799 --> 18:36.400
Even if it costs me my life,

18:36.400 --> 18:37.999
I will do my absolute best.

18:37.999 --> 18:39.120
Don't worry.

18:39.120 --> 18:40.600
Ye.

18:40.600 --> 18:42.440
Take good care of yourself here.

18:42.440 --> 18:43.640
If anything happens,

18:43.640 --> 18:45.160
call me anytime.

18:45.160 --> 18:46.869
I'm off.

18:53.735 --> 18:56.035
[Xuan Island Barbershop]

19:09.680 --> 19:11.162
Ye.

19:11.759 --> 19:13.120
This is Xuan Island.

19:13.120 --> 19:16.497
Welcome to Xuan Island. This is my little shop.

19:16.497 --> 19:18.479
It might look a bit messy,

19:18.479 --> 19:20.440
but there's

19:20.440 --> 19:23.148
order in the chaos.

19:23.148 --> 19:24.440
This is Liu Nian, my apprentice.

19:24.440 --> 19:25.559
Hello.

19:25.559 --> 19:27.299
Go sweep up the firecrackers outside.

19:27.299 --> 19:28.519
Don't let the neighbors complain.

19:28.519 --> 19:30.456
Okay.

19:42.840 --> 19:44.522
Thank you.

19:49.759 --> 19:51.385
30,000?

19:52.120 --> 19:54.897
Didn't we agree on 50,000?

19:54.897 --> 19:56.759
This is what I've decided.

19:56.759 --> 19:59.079
Our place here,

19:59.079 --> 20:00.319
though it's small,

20:00.319 --> 20:04.097
it has everything you need.

20:04.097 --> 20:05.719
We had a deal.

20:05.719 --> 20:07.840
50,000 for room and board.

20:07.840 --> 20:09.400
Did you get the amount wrong?

20:09.400 --> 20:12.239
I won't be staying here for long.

20:12.239 --> 20:13.960
This money...

20:13.960 --> 20:15.239
Compared to a hotel,

20:15.239 --> 20:16.360
it's more than enough.

20:16.360 --> 20:17.680
The remaining 20,000

20:17.680 --> 20:19.319
will be the final payment.

20:19.319 --> 20:20.920
I'll give it to you when I leave.

20:20.920 --> 20:22.885
Okay.

20:22.885 --> 20:24.600
We're all family here.

20:24.600 --> 20:27.079
Just make yourself at home, okay?

20:27.079 --> 20:32.160
I promise, staying here will feel like home.

20:32.160 --> 20:33.319
This is my son,

20:33.319 --> 20:35.072
Xing Wu.

20:38.480 --> 20:40.120
This is your cousin from Beijing,

20:40.120 --> 20:42.144
Qing Ye.

20:51.960 --> 20:54.200
I have to go next door in a bit.

20:54.200 --> 20:58.597
So, um... Take Qing Ye to show her around.

20:59.640 --> 21:02.092
I'm busy. No time.

21:13.239 --> 21:15.719
It's fine. I'll take you upstairs.

21:15.719 --> 21:17.547
Let's see the room.

21:47.720 --> 21:49.139
Seriously,

21:49.139 --> 21:52.020
what on earth do you have in here?

21:52.020 --> 21:55.010
This is way too heavy.

21:56.719 --> 21:58.239
Come on.

21:58.239 --> 21:59.822
Here.

22:03.840 --> 22:08.822
This is where my son repairs phones and things.

22:11.120 --> 22:12.400
Come in.

22:12.400 --> 22:14.322
You'll sleep here.

22:17.799 --> 22:19.559
I'm sleeping here?

22:19.559 --> 22:21.239
Isn't this your son's room?

22:21.239 --> 22:22.360
That's right.

22:22.360 --> 22:24.520
He doesn't come back much. Always out there.

22:24.520 --> 22:26.200
Look how nice it is to sleep here.

22:26.200 --> 22:28.640
Facing the sea, with spring blossoms.

22:28.640 --> 22:30.440
You sleep here,

22:30.440 --> 22:31.440
and he sleeps there.

22:31.440 --> 22:33.719
If you find it inconvenient,

22:33.719 --> 22:35.559
there's a curtain in the middle.

22:35.559 --> 22:37.799
And if you still find it inconvenient,

22:37.799 --> 22:39.640
I'll replace it with a board.

22:39.640 --> 22:40.759
How about that?

22:40.759 --> 22:43.156
Are there any other options?

22:49.479 --> 22:52.097
Come, take a look.

22:52.097 --> 22:54.319
This is my room.

22:54.319 --> 22:55.640
It may look small,

22:55.640 --> 22:58.079
It's small but well-arranged.

22:58.079 --> 23:00.110
Cluttered but orderly.

23:00.759 --> 23:01.960
Take a look.

23:01.960 --> 23:03.360
You can stay here.

23:03.360 --> 23:05.760
It'll be ready once it's tidied up.

23:07.239 --> 23:09.697
So, which room?

23:11.947 --> 23:13.440
Oh my god, this...

23:13.440 --> 23:16.239
Don't be scared. It's okay.

23:16.239 --> 23:19.640
This? Liu Nian uses this for hair rollers.

23:19.640 --> 23:20.840
Have you decided?

23:20.840 --> 23:22.960
Fang, we're waiting for you!

23:22.960 --> 23:24.160
Hurry up!

23:24.160 --> 23:25.759
Coming!

23:25.759 --> 23:28.319
How about this? Take your time.

23:28.319 --> 23:30.600
I'm going to play a few rounds.

23:30.600 --> 23:33.200
I'll have Xing Wu show you around later.

23:33.200 --> 23:36.247
Just go to him if you need anything.

23:36.247 --> 23:39.210
There, there, don't be scared.

23:53.479 --> 23:54.880
What are you doing?

23:54.880 --> 23:56.239
Who upset you?

23:56.239 --> 23:57.880
Why are you so cold to your cousin?

23:57.880 --> 23:59.600
You two used to play together
when you were little.

23:59.600 --> 24:01.600
You went beachcombing. Forgot?

24:01.600 --> 24:03.880
The poor girl has had it rough.

24:03.880 --> 24:05.999
Her mother passed away years ago.

24:05.999 --> 24:10.519
I bet if it weren't for the trouble at home,
her dad would never have sent her here.

24:10.519 --> 24:11.920
We haven't been in touch for years,

24:11.920 --> 24:13.747
and she only comes when in trouble.

24:14.360 --> 24:15.680
My sister was so good to me.

24:15.680 --> 24:17.880
I was sent to live with them when I was eight.

24:17.880 --> 24:20.840
She treated me just like her own sister.

24:20.840 --> 24:22.559
Besides, after I was pregnant with you,

24:22.559 --> 24:25.785
she secretly gave me a lot of money.

24:26.799 --> 24:28.999
Service with a smile, okay?

24:28.999 --> 24:31.148
She's an honored guest.

24:32.039 --> 24:33.640
Ye,

24:33.640 --> 24:35.200
if Xing Wu isn't around,

24:35.200 --> 24:38.310
you can ask Liu Nian for help.

24:38.920 --> 24:40.374
Wu.

24:40.374 --> 24:41.947
Okay.

24:45.385 --> 24:46.835
Hey.

24:46.835 --> 24:49.319
Where's the bathroom?

24:49.319 --> 24:50.317
Outside.

24:50.317 --> 24:51.840
It's shared.

24:51.840 --> 24:53.000
Shared?

24:53.000 --> 24:55.160
Is there a problem?

24:56.640 --> 24:57.799
Also...

24:57.799 --> 24:58.880
This is my grandma's room.

24:58.880 --> 24:59.880
She's resting.

24:59.880 --> 25:01.319
Don't go in unless you have to.

25:01.319 --> 25:03.160
Don't touch anything on the first floor.

25:03.160 --> 25:05.120
This is my number.

25:05.120 --> 25:07.033
I have things to do.

25:10.079 --> 25:12.535
Call me if anything.

26:16.120 --> 26:18.560
[Temporary Residency Service Contract]

27:18.840 --> 27:20.497
Mom.

27:21.719 --> 27:24.120
Sweetie, you're awake.

27:24.120 --> 27:25.239
Mom.

27:25.239 --> 27:27.319
I just had a nightmare.

27:27.319 --> 27:29.347
It scared me.

27:30.160 --> 27:31.640
Silly child.

27:31.640 --> 27:33.200
It was just a dream.

27:33.200 --> 27:36.185
What did you dream about?
Tell me about it.

27:36.840 --> 27:38.600
I dreamed of a place

27:38.600 --> 27:41.039
called Zhazhating.

27:41.039 --> 27:42.680
I met my aunt,

27:42.680 --> 27:44.559
Li Lan Fang,

27:44.559 --> 27:47.039
and her son, Xing Wu.

27:47.039 --> 27:48.400
And also...

27:48.400 --> 27:50.960
his friends.

27:50.960 --> 27:52.680
They were so weird.

27:52.680 --> 27:55.120
Their hair was all colors,
and they had bad attitudes.

27:55.120 --> 27:57.310
I didn't like it at all.

27:57.880 --> 27:59.120
Don't be afraid.

27:59.120 --> 28:01.810
It was only a dream.

28:16.440 --> 28:17.935
Mom.

28:18.920 --> 28:19.999
Mom.

28:19.999 --> 28:20.999
Mom.

28:20.999 --> 28:22.660
Mom.

28:31.039 --> 28:32.319
What are you doing here?

28:32.319 --> 28:34.160
Having a nightmare?

28:35.440 --> 28:37.197
No, I'm not.

28:38.680 --> 28:40.360
Good.

28:42.999 --> 28:44.797
Do you need something?

28:45.719 --> 28:47.400
My honored guest,

28:47.400 --> 28:50.072
my mom's calling you downstairs for dinner.

28:51.160 --> 28:53.010
I got it.

29:05.600 --> 29:08.520
Ye, come and eat.

29:10.239 --> 29:11.840
Auntie,

29:11.840 --> 29:15.319
is the light here always this dim?

29:15.319 --> 29:17.239
Yes.

29:17.239 --> 29:18.920
Did you ask Grandma?

29:18.920 --> 29:21.880
Is she coming out to eat,
or should we bring it to her?

29:21.880 --> 29:24.210
Grandma said she's not hungry yet.

29:26.147 --> 29:28.710
Xing Wu's grandma has bad legs.

29:28.710 --> 29:30.120
Well, today,

29:30.120 --> 29:31.680
to welcome Ye,

29:31.680 --> 29:33.440
I specially made three dishes.

29:33.440 --> 29:34.680
The soup is in the pot.

29:34.680 --> 29:36.640
It'll be ready in a bit.

29:36.640 --> 29:37.759
Here, Ye.

29:37.759 --> 29:40.920
Have a piece of meat.

29:41.920 --> 29:43.120
Thank you.

29:43.120 --> 29:45.200
I don't eat meat at night.

29:46.200 --> 29:47.759
You don't eat meat?

29:47.759 --> 29:50.560
You're still growing. How can you not eat meat?

29:50.560 --> 29:54.120
Consuming too much fat is bad for health.

29:54.920 --> 29:56.600
Then have some seafood.

29:56.600 --> 29:57.600
Clams won't make you fat.

29:57.600 --> 29:59.559
Eat up.

29:59.559 --> 30:01.319
As the saying goes,

30:01.319 --> 30:03.799
"Oysters in cold water, clams in hot water."

30:03.799 --> 30:05.720
With a spoonful of lard,

30:05.720 --> 30:08.090
it's incredibly delicious.

30:08.090 --> 30:10.280
Stir-frying with lard is delicious!

30:10.280 --> 30:12.560
I don't eat lard.

30:14.319 --> 30:15.760
Don't eat it if you don't want to.

30:15.760 --> 30:17.079
Wu.

30:17.079 --> 30:18.920
Go across the street later.

30:18.920 --> 30:20.239
Get Ye a bowl of noodles.

30:20.239 --> 30:21.640
No need.

30:21.640 --> 30:23.597
I'm not hungry.

30:24.999 --> 30:28.430
I came down just to show you this.

30:32.952 --> 30:35.640
Temporary Residency Service Contract.

30:35.640 --> 30:37.719
If you are rich, stay in a hotel.

30:37.719 --> 30:39.680
This childish contract is invalid with me.

30:39.680 --> 30:41.319
What's wrong with a contract?

30:41.319 --> 30:42.960
Ye has already paid.

30:42.960 --> 30:44.799
What's the big deal about signing a contract?

30:44.799 --> 30:45.920
I'll sign it.

30:45.920 --> 30:49.060
You city people
are particular about everything.

30:49.719 --> 30:52.497
There's one more thing I want to say.

30:52.497 --> 30:54.039
During my stay here,

30:54.039 --> 30:57.999
if my personal safety is compromised
or something,

30:57.999 --> 31:00.624
I won't pay the remaining balance.

31:00.624 --> 31:02.572
Don't worry.

31:02.572 --> 31:05.621
Nothing like that will ever happen.

31:06.319 --> 31:08.360
It better be.

31:10.479 --> 31:12.479
Fine. There are two copies of the contract.

31:12.479 --> 31:13.559
You keep this one.

31:13.559 --> 31:15.297
Okay.

31:16.680 --> 31:18.635
I'm going upstairs.

31:20.400 --> 31:22.720
Are you sure you don't eat something?

31:22.720 --> 31:24.735
I'm not hungry.

31:31.400 --> 31:33.160
Is life not hard enough as it is?

31:33.160 --> 31:34.920
Why bring home a princess to serve?

31:34.920 --> 31:38.597
Before you show mercy to others,
can't you get your own life in order first?

31:39.440 --> 31:42.766
Whose fault is it that our lives are like this?

31:42.766 --> 31:45.920
All because of that unreliable Xing Guo Dong.

31:45.920 --> 31:48.480
If he hadn't gambled everything away
and mortgaged Xuan Island,

31:48.480 --> 31:49.720
would I have to scrape together money

31:49.720 --> 31:52.880
for your tuition and
your grandma's medical bills?

31:52.880 --> 31:56.120
Do you think the little you make
from repairs can fill this massive hole?

31:56.120 --> 31:58.840
- Enough already.
- What's enough? I'm not done yet.

31:58.840 --> 32:00.440
Your grandma can't walk well now,

32:00.440 --> 32:01.719
and she has epilepsy.

32:01.719 --> 32:03.999
Every hospital visit costs money.

32:03.999 --> 32:07.479
Let me tell you,
if it weren't for Qing Ye's 30,000 today,

32:07.479 --> 32:12.280
You, me, your grandma,
none of us escapes those debt collectors.

32:12.280 --> 32:14.760
So, she is our savior now.

32:14.760 --> 32:17.000
We have to treat her well!

32:24.400 --> 32:26.097
I know.

32:26.880 --> 32:30.079
It hasn't been easy for you to support us.

32:30.079 --> 32:32.160
As your mother,

32:32.160 --> 32:35.253
my heart aches for you,
and I don't want you to be so exhausted.

32:35.920 --> 32:37.799
Let's pay off the debt first,

32:37.799 --> 32:39.960
and then work hard.

32:39.960 --> 32:43.120
Maybe then you can go back to school.

32:43.759 --> 32:45.799
I believe that with your talent,

32:45.799 --> 32:48.239
you can definitely get into a good college.

32:48.239 --> 32:51.247
Education is the only way out.

32:51.920 --> 32:54.412
Who said I'm going to college?

32:55.413 --> 32:57.785
I can support us.

33:00.039 --> 33:02.680
Can we just treat this money as a loan?

33:02.680 --> 33:05.040
We'll pay her back
when we have the money, okay?

33:05.040 --> 33:07.160
You know, to our family, she's like

33:07.160 --> 33:10.560
'A terrible hand,
but pulled a winning tile after a kong'.

33:10.560 --> 33:14.240
Li Lan Fang,
why must you relate everything to mahjong?

33:14.240 --> 33:19.160
Well, son.
Look, everyone needs a pillar of support.

33:19.160 --> 33:21.400
You can't overanalyze everything.

33:21.400 --> 33:22.802
Take me, for example.

33:22.802 --> 33:23.840
In this life,

33:23.840 --> 33:25.960
I'm here to pay back Xing Guo Dong's debt.

33:25.960 --> 33:27.840
And you,

33:27.840 --> 33:30.160
you're here to pay back mine.

33:31.999 --> 33:35.860
I went through a lot of pain
to bring you into this world.

33:37.920 --> 33:41.037
Actually, I'm not that hungry.

33:43.006 --> 33:44.400
Playing mahjong again?

33:44.400 --> 33:45.999
Just let me go.

33:45.999 --> 33:47.319
Okay?

33:47.319 --> 33:49.120
Go, go, go.

33:49.120 --> 33:52.572
All right! Clean up these things, okay?

34:12.360 --> 34:13.960
Wu.

34:13.960 --> 34:16.183
Wu.

34:19.960 --> 34:21.440
- Grandma.
- Come in.

34:21.440 --> 34:22.840
Here.

34:23.920 --> 34:26.800
I know it's not easy for you and your mom.

34:26.800 --> 34:28.679
Don't be angry with her.

34:28.679 --> 34:30.240
Just let her go.

34:30.240 --> 34:33.747
When she's playing mahjong,
she's actually a bit happier.

34:36.679 --> 34:38.559
I know, Grandma.

34:38.559 --> 34:41.235
I'll go get you some food.

34:41.235 --> 34:42.559
I'm not hungry.

34:42.559 --> 34:45.785
Eating too much at night is bad for digestion.

34:46.920 --> 34:49.079
Don't you love steamed eggs with sea urchin?

34:49.079 --> 34:50.360
Once I get paid for this job,

34:50.360 --> 34:52.135
I'll buy some for you.

34:53.079 --> 34:56.247
My grandson is so filial.

35:02.199 --> 35:03.735
What happened?

35:03.735 --> 35:05.740
Must be a power outage.

35:06.400 --> 35:08.622
I'll go check, Grandma.

35:17.639 --> 35:19.642
I left in such a hurry this time.

35:19.642 --> 35:21.440
I didn't bring anything.

35:21.440 --> 35:24.039
I even left my laptop at school.

35:24.039 --> 35:26.235
Okay, I'll mail it to you tomorrow.

35:27.039 --> 35:29.199
Send it express.
I need it to register for classes.

35:29.199 --> 35:31.822
Okay, don't worry. I got it.

35:31.822 --> 35:35.440
Qing Ye, how long do you plan to stay there?

35:35.440 --> 35:36.840
Let me see...

35:36.840 --> 35:38.000
Look...

35:38.000 --> 35:40.280
Registering for classes,
waiting for the visa...

35:40.280 --> 35:41.566
By the way, Le Ling,

35:41.566 --> 35:44.721
did you get my proof of assets ready?

35:44.721 --> 35:45.761
Almost.

35:45.761 --> 35:47.039
I'm asking my mom to move some funds.

35:47.039 --> 35:48.400
It should be ready by next week.

35:48.400 --> 35:49.880
That's great.

35:49.880 --> 35:51.840
Then I guess I'll only be here a month.

35:51.840 --> 35:55.239
A month. Then I can finally leave this dump.

35:55.239 --> 35:56.822
Let me show you guys.

35:57.559 --> 36:00.585
Qing Ye, why haven't you turned on the lights?

36:01.360 --> 36:02.440
Can you believe it?

36:02.440 --> 36:03.559
There's a power outage here.

36:03.559 --> 36:04.559
A power outage?

36:04.559 --> 36:06.119
How can there be a power outage?

36:06.119 --> 36:09.519
Qing Ye, did you really go on X-Change?

36:09.519 --> 36:11.360
I'm telling you, it's unbelievable.

36:11.360 --> 36:13.079
It's so bizarre.

36:13.079 --> 36:14.840
Forget it.

36:14.840 --> 36:16.329
Not in the mood.

36:16.329 --> 36:18.000
Hey, don't you have a cousin there?

36:18.000 --> 36:19.597
How is he?

36:19.597 --> 36:21.079
Him?

36:21.079 --> 36:24.679
It's a long story.
His hair's so weird, not golden, not silver.

36:24.679 --> 36:25.960
And he has a foul temper.

36:25.960 --> 36:28.840
He's exactly like some punk you'd imagine.

36:28.840 --> 36:30.400
Just like a little thug.

36:30.400 --> 36:31.519
Qing Ye!

36:31.519 --> 36:33.909
There's a ghost behind you!

36:36.541 --> 36:38.352
Ugh. You walk without making a sound?

36:38.352 --> 36:42.280
So I can hear you talking behind my back.

36:42.280 --> 36:44.497
Talk to you guys later.

36:51.440 --> 36:53.210
Stay in the dark then.

37:06.635 --> 37:07.997
[Xuan Island Barbershop]

37:24.559 --> 37:28.022
What's that smell? So pungent.

37:29.480 --> 37:30.800
Haven't you ever used a mosquito coil?

37:30.800 --> 37:32.400
Don't you have electric ones here?

37:32.400 --> 37:33.840
The odorless, non-toxic kind.

37:33.840 --> 37:35.639
We have plenty of sea mosquitoes here.

37:35.639 --> 37:38.360
This kind of coil works best.

37:41.079 --> 37:42.747
By the way,

37:43.519 --> 37:45.360
a friendly tip.

37:45.360 --> 37:47.960
These mosquitoes can bite a pig to death.

37:47.960 --> 37:49.119
How many times have you been bitten?

37:49.119 --> 37:50.835
Who are you calling a pig?

37:51.480 --> 37:53.840
It seems my summary of you
wasn't thorough enough.

37:53.840 --> 37:57.182
Add two more. Sarcastic! Mysterious!

37:57.182 --> 37:58.440
And one more thing.

37:58.440 --> 37:59.840
Don't talk to me much.

37:59.840 --> 38:01.710
I'm a germaphobe.

38:14.039 --> 38:15.119
What now?

38:15.119 --> 38:17.147
Another blackout.

38:18.719 --> 38:19.960
What are you doing?

38:19.960 --> 38:21.440
Didn't you say it was too dark?

38:21.440 --> 38:23.610
I'm giving you a brighter one.

38:34.199 --> 38:35.800
Don't just stand there.

38:35.800 --> 38:38.528
The light bulb. Give me a hand.

38:39.239 --> 38:41.747
Can't you come down and get it yourself?

38:50.679 --> 38:53.101
Don't look at me like that.

38:53.101 --> 38:54.199
In a month at most,

38:54.199 --> 38:56.039
I'll be leaving here to study abroad.

38:56.039 --> 38:58.760
I'll just treat this like a summer break.

38:58.760 --> 39:01.920
During it, you have the right to be annoyed,
hate me, or dislike me.

39:01.920 --> 39:04.160
But I won't change.

39:06.240 --> 39:08.221
That's the deal between Party A and B.

39:08.221 --> 39:09.680
We endure each other for a month,

39:09.680 --> 39:11.760
and then we're done.

39:23.880 --> 39:25.360
One month at most.

39:25.360 --> 39:26.679
Leave as soon as possible.

39:26.679 --> 39:28.159
Never see you again.

39:28.159 --> 39:30.522
We're on the same page.

39:32.640 --> 39:34.604
Wait.

39:35.360 --> 39:38.719
There are so many sea mosquitoes here.
Do you have any effective repellent?

39:38.719 --> 39:40.935
Some floral water would do.

39:42.000 --> 39:43.360
This is all we have.

39:43.360 --> 39:45.640
Will this work? I don't like the smell.

39:45.640 --> 39:47.800
Don't be picky if you don't want scars.

39:47.800 --> 39:49.822
Take it or leave it.

39:51.880 --> 39:54.092
One more.

39:55.320 --> 39:57.258
Where's the bathroom?

40:10.480 --> 40:11.922
We're here.

40:12.535 --> 40:14.235
Right here.

40:17.800 --> 40:19.679
This is... the bathroom?

40:19.679 --> 40:20.800
Yeah.

40:20.800 --> 40:22.280
A communal bathroom?

40:22.280 --> 40:25.880
I mean... How can neighbors share a bathroom?

40:25.880 --> 40:27.160
You're in Zhazhating.

40:27.160 --> 40:29.240
This is all you got here.

40:35.679 --> 40:38.860
- Right here.
- Why does it smell so bad?

40:40.520 --> 40:43.171
That's rusty!

40:44.920 --> 40:48.054
The floor is so filthy.

40:49.199 --> 40:53.639
The shampoo comes in a bucket, seriously?
How am I supposed to wash here?

40:53.639 --> 40:55.559
There's a water heater and a showerhead.

40:55.559 --> 40:57.480
Why can't you wash?

40:57.480 --> 40:58.920
You're in Zhazhating.

40:58.920 --> 41:00.239
This is all you got here.

41:00.239 --> 41:01.480
What about the door?

41:01.480 --> 41:03.832
How do I lock it?

41:11.679 --> 41:13.222
Well...

41:18.039 --> 41:19.840
There's a hole here.

41:19.840 --> 41:21.840
It's fallen into disrepair. It's broken.

41:21.840 --> 41:23.880
Are you kidding me?

41:23.880 --> 41:25.199
If someone comes by,

41:25.199 --> 41:27.119
they could just squat down and watch me bathe.

41:27.119 --> 41:30.320
It's a hot day.
No one will come here to watch you bathe.

41:30.320 --> 41:33.097
Just pull the curtain closed.

41:33.097 --> 41:36.038
You're in Zhazhating. This is all you got here.

41:40.360 --> 41:42.600
That shampoo...

41:42.600 --> 41:45.400
Is there any other kind?

41:46.400 --> 41:47.497
Yes.

41:47.497 --> 41:49.472
Hey! Wait a second.

41:50.440 --> 41:51.840
Body wash?

41:51.840 --> 41:53.748
Soap.

41:55.519 --> 41:57.992
I'm not used to using soap.

41:59.119 --> 42:00.920
Look.

42:00.920 --> 42:02.320
What are your requirements?

42:02.320 --> 42:04.322
Tell me everything at once.

42:05.000 --> 42:07.320
Shampoo. I want silicone-free shampoo.

